 NAME:
	ASTRMFIX
 PURPOSE:
	This program will calculate a rough HST WFPC or FOC astrometry solution
	using the keyword PSANGLEV3 which gives the angle of the V3 axis of
	HST.    Called by WFPCREAD.

 CALLING SEQEUNCE:
