 NAME:
	DB_ENT2HOST
 PURPOSE:
	Converts a database entry from external (IEEE) data format to host
	format after reading it from the file.  Called from DBRD and DBEXT_DBF.

 CALLING SEQUENCE:
	DB_ENT2HOST, ENTRY, DBNO

 INPUTS:
	ENTRY	= Byte array containing a single record read from the
		  database file.
	DBNO	= Number of the opened database file.

 OUTPUTS:
	ENTRY	= The converted array is returned in place of the input array.

 COMMON BLOCKS:
	DB_COM

