 NAME:
       REPCHR
 PURPOSE:
       Replace all occurrences of one character with another in a text string.
 CATEGORY:
 CALLING SEQUENCE:
       new = repchr(old, c1, [c2])
 INPUTS:
       old = original text string.          in
       c1 = character to replace.           in
       c2 = character to replace it with.   in
            default is space.
 KEYWORD PARAMETERS:
 OUTPUTS:
