 NAME:
	TBINFO
 PURPOSE:
	Procedure to return information on the specified field 
	in a FITS binary table.

 CALLING SEQUENCE:
	tbinfo, h, tbcol, width, idltype, numval, tunit, tnull, tform, 
		ttype, maxval
 INPUTS:
