	W. Landsman handle formats without repeat counts.    Sep. 1993
	Use double complex datatype if V4.0 or later       July, 1995
	Corrected if-else-end imbalance.  M. Greason       Aug. 1995
	Removed call to SINCE_VERSION()   W. Landsman      March 1996
