 NAME:
       YDN2MD
 PURPOSE:
       Convert from year and day number of year to month and day of month.
 CATEGORY:
 CALLING SEQUENCE:
       ydn2md,yr,dy,m,d
 INPUTS:
       yr = year (like 1988).               in
       dy = day number in year (like 310).  in
 KEYWORD PARAMETERS:
 OUTPUTS:
       m = month number (like 11 = Nov).    out
       d = day of month (like 5).           out
